<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Turn again our captivity, O Lord, as the streams,</l><l>As the streams in the south,</l><l>As the streams in the south.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>They that sow in tears shall reap in joy,</l><l>They that sow in tears shall reap in joy.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>When the Lord turned again the captivity of Zion,</l><l>We were like them that dream,</l><l>We were like them that dream.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
